// A negative limit of task.receive_within is a runtime error, which halts the
// program (spec/04-semantics.md, task.receive_within, step 1). The mailbox
// holds a message, so a call that checks its limit late would return it.
// STATUS: error
// CHECK: before
var me = task.self();
task.send(me, 1);
print "before";
task.receive_within(-1);
print "after";
